    "detailed_description": "A horror game about a hiker who found himself in an unknown area with no map after falling down a mountain.<br />\r\nThe player in this game must follow the path that should lead him to an abandoned house above the hill and there the main story will take place.<br />\r\nIt is a first person horror game about a story of a family that lived in a house far away from society, and what happened to that family will be revealed in the game.<br />\r\nThe player can interact with objects, read letters and run away from enemies.<br />\r\nThe game contains jumpscares and loud noises as well.",
    "about_the_game": "A horror game about a hiker who found himself in an unknown area with no map after falling down a mountain.<br />\r\nThe player in this game must follow the path that should lead him to an abandoned house above the hill and there the main story will take place.<br />\r\nIt is a first person horror game about a story of a family that lived in a house far away from society, and what happened to that family will be revealed in the game.<br />\r\nThe player can interact with objects, read letters and run away from enemies.<br />\r\nThe game contains jumpscares and loud noises as well.",
    "short_description": "A hiker twists his foot in a dangerous curve in a mountain and finds himself in an unknown area. Injured and lost, all he can do is search for a shelter that protects him from dangerous animals.",
